# Playtest feedback, written live by the in-game notes box. Local by design:
# it is a scratchpad that fills up fast during a session, and the useful bits
# get lifted out of it into commits and issues rather than committed raw.
DEV-NOTES.md

# Live telemetry from the flight recorder — one line every few seconds.
SESSION.log

# Accumulated triage of the telemetry and the notes, appended overnight. Local
# for the same reason as the two above: it is working material, and the useful
# bits become commits and issues rather than being committed raw.
FINDINGS.md

# Live chat log and outgoing line for the in-game presence (server/claude.js).
CHAT.log
SAY.txt

DO.txt

# The agent play harness, injected into the page by hand during testing.
# Dev tooling: it only reads the simulation and pushes the intents a keyboard
# would. Never imported by the game itself.
playharness.js
